    "Each day at this hour you'll get one goal and one photo from your board. Reminders go out on the hour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada día a esta hora recibirás una meta y una foto de tu tablero. Los recordatorios salen a la hora en punto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each day at this time you'll get one goal and one photo from your board. The weekly recap comes on Sunday, and if you're away for a week, a check-in brings your board back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada día a esta hora recibirás una meta y una foto de tu tablero. El resumen semanal llega el domingo, y si pasas una semana sin entrar, te recordamos tu tablero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
